{"chars": "One half of the greenhouse is Mrs. Claus's kitchen garden. Tomatoes hang red and round as Christmas ornaments. Strawberries peek out from under their leaves. There are rows of crunchy lettuce, fat orange carrots, and herbs that smell wonderful when you brush past them: mint, basil and dill. In one corner hums a wooden beehive, where the bees make golden honey from the greenhouse flowers. Almost everything the elves eat in winter grows right here.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.812, 0.812, 0.812, 0.812, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.538, 1.538, 1.538, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 1.7, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 2.85, 3.6, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 4.3, 4.3, 4.3, 4.3, 4.3, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.525, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.825, 4.95, 4.95, 4.95, 4.95, 4.95, 4.95, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 5.95, 6.8, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 8.062, 8.062, 8.062, 8.062, 8.062, 8.062, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.45, 8.45, 8.45, 8.45, 8.45, 8.45, 8.45, 9.175, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.25, 9.4, 9.4, 9.4, 9.4, 9.5, 9.5, 9.5, 9.5, 9.5, 9.838, 9.838, 9.838, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.925, 11.037, 11.037, 11.037, 11.037, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.325, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 12.3, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12.512, 12.512, 12.512, 12.512, 12.512, 12.512, 12.925, 12.925, 12.925, 12.925, 12.925, 13.137, 13.137, 13.137, 13.137, 13.137, 13.137, 13.47